  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">•<strong> About our brand and products:</strong></p><div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">R5® is a daily performance and recovery supplement designed for active adults in their 40s and 50s — people who still train hard, play sport, and refuse to slow down. It combines seven scientifically supported ingredients — Creatine Monohydrate, RedNite® Beetroot, L-Carnitine, L-Arginine, L-Taurine, L-Theanine, and Pomegranate — to support muscle strength, cardiovascular health, energy metabolism, mental clarity, and recovery.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>• What makes us different:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">We specifially cater for adults approaching 40 to 55/60 years old. We are not replacement but rather a supplement aimed at strength &amp; recovery. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">15% commision on every sale</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Mainly through your social channels. We can also provide an additional discount code you can use to promote to your channels to offer specailly for your followers. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">eg JANE20 </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>• Other information:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Open to ideas and collaborations.</p></div></div></div></div>",
